OL,3,GNEWSAFlooded four times in six years,
OL,4,Avillagers fear another wet winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a Herefordshire village
OL,7,Fflooded four times in the past six
OL,8,Fyears say they are anxious about the
OL,9,Fmonths ahead as forecasters warn of an
OL,10,Fincreased likelihood of
OL,11,Fwetter-than-average conditions this
OL,12,Fautumn and winter.
OL,14,FNearly a year after flood-water forced
OL,15,FKate Reed from her home in Ewyas
OL,16,FHarold, she admits heavy rain still
OL,17,Fmakes her nervous.
OL,19,FWhen Dulas Brook burst its banks during
OL,20,FStorm Claudia in November 2025, a foot
OL,21,Fof water swept through her property.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
